    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104701" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῆμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετραίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>perforation, aperture, orifice,</i>
